    <item>
      <title>School Choices &amp; Education Pathways in Anne Arundel County</title>
      <link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/schools-education-pathways/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/schools-education-pathways/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;School Choices &amp;amp; Education Pathways in Anne Arundel County&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;school-choices--education-pathways-in-anne-arundel-county&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#school-choices--education-pathways-in-anne-arundel-county&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Understanding Anne Arundel County Public Schools (AACPS)&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;understanding-anne-arundel-county-public-schools-aacps&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#understanding-anne-arundel-county-public-schools-aacps&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;District Overview&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;district-overview&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#district-overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anne Arundel County Public Schools&lt;/strong&gt; serves approximately 55,000+ students across 80+ schools. As one of Maryland&amp;rsquo;s largest and highest-performing districts, AACPS offers diverse educational options for students from kindergarten through 12th grade.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Schools &amp; Education Pathways in Anne Arundel County</title>
      <link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/schools-education-pathways/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/schools-education-pathways/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Schools &amp;amp; Education Pathways in Anne Arundel County&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;schools--education-pathways-in-anne-arundel-county&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#schools--education-pathways-in-anne-arundel-county&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated reading time: 6 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;As a mother of three children who has navigated the Anne Arundel County school system for over a decade, I know how overwhelming choosing the right school can be. You&amp;rsquo;re not just picking a building with a name on the sign - you&amp;rsquo;re choosing your child&amp;rsquo;s social environment, their academic foundation, and often, where you&amp;rsquo;ll spend the next several years living.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>AACPS Enrollment Guide</title>
      <link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/enrollment-guide/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/enrollment-guide/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;AACPS Enrollment Guide&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;aacps-enrollment-guide&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#aacps-enrollment-guide&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Enrolling your child in Anne Arundel County Public Schools requires specific documentation and following the right process. This guide walks through what you need and when to do it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Determining Your School Zone&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;determining-your-school-zone&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#determining-your-school-zone&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;School Assignment&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;school-assignment&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#school-assignment&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public schools are assigned by address.&lt;/strong&gt; Your specific street address determines which elementary, middle, and high school your child attends.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
